{
  "family": "Bookman Old Style GO",
  "source": {
    "kind": "hmtx",
    "date": "2026-10-29",
    "fonts": [
      "Bookman Old Style (Word DFonts: Bookman Old Style.ttf, Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)",
      "Caladea"
    ],
    "probe": "hmtx advance-ratio buckets (<= 1.5 % span, build-font-aliases.mjs --refit-buckets); Word paces Bookman at its own advances (production PDF spans / hmtx = 1.000 over 96 lines)"
  },
  "refit": {
    "method": "hmtx-buckets",
    "span": 0.015,
    "range": "U+0020-007E, U+00A0-00FF, U+2013-2015, U+2017-201E, U+2020-2022, U+2026, U+20AC",
    "cuts": {
      "normal/normal": {
        "word": "dfonts:Bookman Old Style.ttf",
        "base": "repo:apps/docs/src/renderer/fonts/Caladea-Regular.ttf",
        "src": "url('./Caladea-Regular.ttf')"
      },
      "bold/normal": {
        "word": "dfonts:Bookman Old Style Bold.ttf",
        "base": "repo:apps/docs/src/renderer/fonts/Caladea-Bold.ttf",
        "src": "url('./Caladea-Bold.ttf')"
      },
      "normal/italic": {
        "word": "dfonts:Bookman Old Style Italic.ttf",
        "base": "repo:apps/docs/src/renderer/fonts/Caladea-Italic.ttf",
        "src": "url('./Caladea-Italic.ttf')"
      },
      "bold/italic": {
        "word": "dfonts:Bookman Old Style Bold Italic.ttf",
        "base": "repo:apps/docs/src/renderer/fonts/Caladea-BoldItalic.ttf",
        "src": "url('./Caladea-BoldItalic.ttf')"
      }
    }
  },
  "note": "Bookman Old Style ships only inside Office (Word's DFonts), so Chromium fell to the\nname-guess sans chain (Helvetica), 0.80x the Word line width (corpus 2026-10-29: 201\nmatched lines, median 0.796). Faces are advance-ratio buckets over Caladea: every\nLatin-1 / general-punctuation glyph's Word advance / Caladea advance, grouped greedily\ninto buckets no wider than 1.5 %, one size-adjusted face per bucket with an explicit\nunicode-range (later faces win inside their range; the rangeless face carries the\nlowercase ratio for everything else). Per-class faces (lowercase / capitals / digits)\nmissed single lines by up to 5 % on Indonesian legal text and re-wrapped them; 3 % buckets left the\nfrequent lowercase 0.3 % wide in aggregate on a plain-text document and gained a\npage (validation 2026-10-29); 1.5 % buckets are within 0.02 %. Pitch stays the hhea 1.1738 the resolver\nreads from word-faces.json.",
